    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970428.0071\n\nMOGADISHU, April 28 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT At least 17 killed in Mogadishu clashes\n\n\n\n\nAt least 17 militiamen and civilians were killed and 26 other people wounded during heavy factional fighting which erupted in the Somali capital overnight, medical sources and witnesses said Monday.",
